      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙表现出兴趣的对象是──\n菱钻奇宝。\n世人对她的评价是普通到不行的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f72819ed2751e997fadbf2680885ac0425d97c72776f9b3ce2134e2b7e6a093",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
