      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是我去询问没有获得经典三冠\n仍然成为最强赛马娘的“怪物”小栗帽，\n是不是不参加经典三冠更有机会变强？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f83d762c80411dac8f35db74c9e6937a998a19680f4600d59ffaf790c70cc030",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
